        {
          "character": "Red Chief",
          "x": 0.45,
          "scale": 0.5,
          "facing": -1
        }
      ],
      "shots": [
        {
          "id": "sc1-sh1",
          "beats": [
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Sam",
              "text": "It looked like a cinch, Bill. Sleepy little town. One rich man. One small son. Two thousand dollars ransom by Friday.",
              "duration": 8.43,
              "pose": "point"
            },
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Bill",
              "text": "Kidnapping is a low business, Sam, but the land deal won't wait. There's the kid now — throwing rocks at a cat.",
              "duration": 8.81,
              "pose": "talk"
            }
          ],
          "camera": {
            "from": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0.46,
              "zoom": 0.95
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sc1-sh2",
          "beats": [
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Sam",
              "text": "Hey, little boy! Would you like a bag of candy and a nice ride?",
              "duration": 5.73,
              "pose": "talk"
            },
            {
              "type": "pause",
              "duration": 0.4
            },
            {
              "type": "sound",
              "sound": "boom",
              "gain": 0.5
            },
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Bill",
              "text": "OW! He hit me! Right in the eye! With a BRICK!",
              "duration": 4.58,
              "pose": "shrug"
            },
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Red Chief",
              "text": "That's for sneaking up on Red Chief, terror of the plains! Do it again and I won't miss the other eye!",
              "duration": 8.43,
              "pose": "point"
            }
          ],
          "camera": {
            "from": {
              "x": 0.32,
              "y": 0.46,
              "zoom": 1.25
            }
          },
          "cues": [
            {
              "shake": 0.025,
              "at": 3.2,
              "duration": 0.5
            },
            {
              "target": "Bill",
              "expression": "face_surprised",
              "at": 3.4
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "music": {
        "sound": "caper",
        "gain": 0.28,
        "loop": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sc2",
      "backdropID": "ts_bd_forest",
      "staging": [
        {
          "character": "Red Chief",
          "x": -0.4,
          "scale": 0.5,
          "facing": 1
        },
        {
          "character": "Bill",
          "x": 0.15,
          "scale": 0.62,
          "facing": -1
        },
        {
          "character": "Sam",
          "x": 0.6,
          "scale": 0.62,
          "facing": -1
        }
      ],
      "shots": [
        {
          "id": "sc2-sh1",
          "beats": [
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Red Chief",
              "text": "I never had such fun in my life! I like this camp. Are you going to cook, Old Hank? I'm the chief and you're my prisoner!",
              "duration": 10.35,
              "pose": "point"
            },
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Bill",
              "text": "Sam. He has been riding me around this campfire as a HORSE since sunrise. He put a hot potato down my back. He tried to SCALP me at dawn.",
              "duration": 11.5,
              "pose": "lean"
            },
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Sam",
              "text": "Would you like to go home now, Red Chief?",
              "duration": 3.81,
              "pose": "talk"
            }
          ],
          "camera": {
            "from": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0.46,
              "zoom": 0.95
            }
          },
          "cues": [
            {
              "target": "Red Chief",
              "clip": "jump",
              "at": 0,
              "duration": 1.0
            },
            {
              "target": "Bill",
              "expression": "face_worried",
              "at": 4.0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "sc2-sh2",
          "beats": [
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Red Chief",
              "text": "Aw, what for? I don't have any fun at home. I HATE school. I like camping. You won't take me back, will you?",
              "duration": 9.2,
              "pose": "shrug"
            },
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Bill",
              "text": "…Sam. The ransom note. Make it fifteen hundred. I am telling you, two thousand is more than this child is worth.",
              "duration": 8.43,
              "pose": "idle"
            },
            {
              "type": "sound",
              "sound": "pop",
              "gain": 0.6
            },
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Sam",
              "text": "Fine. Fifteen hundred. Now hold still, Chief — Bill is not a bronco.",
              "duration": 5.35,
              "pose": "point"
            }
          ],
          "camera": {
            "from": {
              "x": -0.28,
              "y": 0.46,
              "zoom": 1.25
            }
          },
          "cues": [
            {
              "target": "Red Chief",
              "clip": "run",
              "at": 6.0,
              "duration": 2.0
            },
            {
              "target": "Red Chief",
              "at": 6.0,
              "duration": 2.0,
              "move": {
                "x": 0.3
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "sc2-sh3",
          "beats": [
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Sam",
              "text": "I rode to town and mailed it. And Bill — the town wasn't worried, exactly. Folks seemed… calm. Suspiciously calm.",
              "duration": 8.04,
              "pose": "lean"
            },
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Bill",
              "text": "Calm how, Sam.",
              "duration": 1.5,
              "pose": "idle"
            },
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Sam",
              "text": "The postmaster said, quote, 'You'll bring him back long before Friday,' unquote. Then he laughed until he sat down.",
              "duration": 7.66,
              "pose": "talk"
            },
            {
              "type": "pause",
              "duration": 0.5
            }
          ],
          "camera": {
            "from": {
              "x": 0.6,
              "y": 0.46,
              "zoom": 2.1
            }
          },
          "cues": [
            {
              "target": "Bill",
              "expression": "face_suspicious",
              "at": 3.0
            },
            {
              "target": "Sam",
              "expression": "face_worried",
              "at": 7.0
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "music": {
        "sound": "caper",
        "gain": 0.24,
